%% Fluxo 1: Painel Operacional (Dashboard) - SUS-Connect APS MVP (Fase 05)

sequenceDiagram
    participant Coord as 👤 Coordenador APS
    participant API as REST API
    participant UC as GetDashboardUseCase
    participant Calc as PriorityCalculator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Coord->>API: GET /api/v1/dashboard
    API->>UC: execute(from, to)
    UC->>DB: busca todos os territórios
    DB-->>UC: lista de Territory + PreventiveIndicators
    UC->>Calc: assess(territory) para cada território
    Calc-->>UC: PriorityAssessment (HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW + razões)
    UC->>DB: busca ações abertas e vencidas no período
    DB-->>UC: lista de SearchAction
    UC-->>API: DashboardOutput
    Note right of UC: highPriorityTerritoryCount<br/>openActionCount<br/>completedActionCount<br/>topPriorities<br/>attentionActions
    API-->>Coord: 200 OK — resumo operacional
